MineSim-MPC-AD-Control
======================

This repository redistributes a strategy overlay for the MineSim / mine_sim
replay simulator used in mining autonomous-driving planning-control contests.

Upstream
--------
- MineSim / mine_sim (and related OnSite-family simulation code) is licensed
  under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (AGPL-3.0). See LICENSE.
- This overlay modifies and extends that AGPL-covered work. Combined use with
  the official simulator is therefore subject to AGPL-3.0.

What this repo does NOT ship
----------------------------
- Official scenario inputs (`inputs/`)
- HD maps / datasets (`datasets/maps/` etc.)
- Docker submission images / platform evaluation data
- Hidden-scenario trajectory packs

You must obtain the official mine_sim package and contest data through
authorized channels, then apply this overlay on top of `devkit/`.

Attribution
-----------
Strategy code, scen_config banks, centerline v2s table, documentation, and
demo videos in this repository were developed for the MPC-AD / mining AD
planning-control track (v63 production line; online baseline referenced as
v58). Absolute local paths were removed for portable open-source release.
